  2.     * Perform Oaxaca-RIF decomposition and save results using putexcel
.     oaxaca_rif ln_wage $exp $education $caste hh_size female ///
>     married child_12 voc_train migrated_fr_job tot_chores_hrs urban overtime_40 ///
>     if year == 2008 , by(formal_employment) wgt(1) rif(q(`q')) rwlogit(HH_formal dep_ratio $exp $education $caste) swap
